-- 6. Handoff — The crate changes hands. A scrape, a latch, one toy tune and
-- one pling. A small ceremony; nobody opens it.
-- ~36 cycles (~94 s at 92 BPM).
-- The `toys:12` and `hit:1` lines are live one-shots: evaluate each on its own,
-- let it ring, then hush d8/d2. Do not let them retrigger for long.

glideBpm 92 16
-- the canteen clears; only the crate and two sets of hands
fadeSilence 12 [1,2,3,7,9]
d6 bassHand
xfadeIn 4 16 compHand
xfadeIn 5 24 colourHand
d1 handStep
xfadeIn 9 16 $ stack [crateScrape, crateThud]
xfadeIn 10 24 air

-- the crate latch
d2 handoffPop
-- the high reed holds one note
xfadeIn 7 24 reedHand

-- the handover itself. Evaluate these two one-shots on their own, wait for
-- the toy, then hush each orbit.
d8 $ slow 4 $ s "toys" # n 12 # loop 0 # hpf 250 # lpf 7000
  # room 0.55 # size 0.7 # amp 0.4
d2 $ slow 4 $ s "hit" # n 1 # loop 0 # hpf 400 # lpf 8000
  # room 0.5 # size 0.65 # amp 0.3

-- let the ceremony ring, then take the room down
fadeSilence 16 [1,2,4,5,6,7,8,9]
xfadeIn 10 24 $ stack [air, windBed]
